recommend keep-going -- the arrangement-graph and (n,k)-star door the paper names is the next measurable moonshot, and it needs no gate: it asks whether the optimal table-free rule survives past the factorial wall, which is the one thing that would make the star family usable at a size a supervision tree actually is.
